#: ../../source/index.md:3 0c848c48a88b4191831070c8386f37db
msgid ""
"Welcome to the documentation for **FiveAges Sim** — a multi-repository "
"ROS 2 robotics ecosystem for control, simulation, and deployment "
"developed by [FiveAges](https://github.com/fiveages-sim)."
msgstr ""
"欢迎阅读 **FiveAges Sim** 文档 — 这是由 [FiveAges](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim) 开发的多仓库 ROS 2 机器人生态系统，覆盖控制、仿真与部署。"

#: ../../source/index.md:8 3b71f71ba49643f98a127dcadbb950d4
msgid ""
"New here? Start with the [Learning Path](0-overview/2-learning_path.md), "
"then [Install Environment](1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md), "
"then [Quick Demo (Public "
"Path)](1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md). Do not skip install."
msgstr "第一次来？请先阅读[学习路径](0-overview/2-learning_path.md)，然后[安装环境](1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md)，再做[快速演示（公开路径）](1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md)。不要跳过安装。"

#: ../../source/index.md:11 4bbd4513851e4821b2377afe6bfa2861
msgid "About This Ecosystem"
msgstr "关于本生态系统"

#: ../../source/index.md:13 c2ce0be3d7b2498ebd18f18ecf336ae6
msgid "FiveAges Sim provides:"
msgstr "FiveAges Sim 提供："

#: ../../source/index.md:15 d47eb9ebcf68430cb56f08d504e716a9
msgid ""
"**Unified robot descriptions** — URDF/xacro packages for wheeled-arm "
"humanoids, manipulators, and mobile robots"
msgstr "**统一的机器人描述** — 覆盖轮臂人形、机械臂和移动机器人的 URDF/xacro 软件包"

#: ../../source/index.md:16 faf5916a52934b2e9bff7bbc300da7bd
msgid ""
"**Driver layer** (驱动层) — ROS 2 control hardware plugins for various robot"
" platforms (Dobot, ARX, Galbot, HighTorque, and more)"
msgstr "**驱动层** — 面向多种机器人平台的 ROS 2 control 硬件插件（Dobot、ARX、Galbot、HighTorque 等）"

#: ../../source/index.md:17 eadd6df21aa1472e94c3dacf6ff8f90a
msgid "**MPC controllers** — OCS2-based arm (分体控制) and 全身控制"
msgstr "**MPC 控制器** — 基于 OCS2 的机械臂（分体控制）与全身控制"

#: ../../source/index.md:18 52686c102de5435ebe499af6dc88f0d5
msgid ""
"**Simulation backends** — Gazebo Harmonic, and **FaSim** (Isaac Sim high-"
"fidelity + ROS 2 运控, matching real-robot motion plus ground truth)"
msgstr ""
"**仿真后端** — Gazebo Harmonic，以及 **FaSim**（Isaac Sim 高保真 + ROS 2 "
"运控，运动对齐真机并带仿真真值）"

#: ../../source/index.md:19 6dc175f17372425b93d82f2f3247685e
msgid ""
"**Teleop solutions** — VR, isomorphic teleop, DexCap, and glove-based "
"teleoperation"
msgstr "**遥操作方案** — VR、同构遥操作、DexCap 以及基于手套的遥操作"

#: ../../source/index.md:20 1fdfd0c2a8424dc48f1fc79c64dcfefa
msgid ""
"**Python libraries** — High-level interfaces for robot control and data "
"collection"
msgstr "**Python 库** — 用于机器人控制与数据采集的高层接口"

#: ../../source/index.md:21 764d4b81e28a4af490fe358594d5dd96
msgid ""
"**Synthetic data pipeline** — Isaac USD scenes, task-queue orchestration,"
" LeRobot record/export"
msgstr "**合成数据流水线** — Isaac USD 场景、任务队列编排、LeRobot 录制/导出"

#: ../../source/index.md:23 5bcfd6e43fc14a8dacfd3d48f8a3fa34
msgid "Two Entry Paths"
msgstr "两条入口路径"

